=== Suspicious stew ===
{{main|Suspicious Stew}}
Suspicious stew that is created using a golden dandelion imparts the [[Saturation (effect)|Saturation]] effect for 0.35 seconds {{in|java}} or 0.3 seconds {{in|bedrock}}. The Saturation effect restores an additional {{hunger|7}} hunger and 14 saturation {{in|java}}, or {{hunger|6}} hunger {{in|bedrock}}. The suspicious stew can be made using a golden dandelion or produced by feeding a dandelion to a non-baby brown [[mooshroom]] and then milking it with a bowl.

{{Crafting
|ignoreusage=1
|Red Mushroom
|Brown Mushroom
|Bowl
|Golden Dandelion
|Output=Suspicious Stew
|shapeless=true
}}

=== Piglins ===
[[Piglin]]s run toward any golden dandelion item on the ground and inspect it for 6 seconds {{in|java}} or 8 seconds {{in|bedrock}}<ref>{{bug|MCPE-99448||Piglins need 8 seconds to barter, while they only need 6 in java}}</ref> before putting it in their inventory.

=== Bee nests ===
[[Oak]], [[birch]], and [[cherry]] trees grown from [[sapling]]s planted within 2 blocks of a golden dandelion have a 5% chance to grow with a [[bee nest]] and 2–3 [[bee]]s in it.

